import VOA.AffineGeneral.SCLieData
import VOA.AffineGeneral.E6Table

set_option linter.style.longLine false

/-!
# E₆ Lie data tables: the invariant form, the dual family, the Casimir

`e6Gm`: the invariant form of `singular_cert/cert_E6.json` (same basis and brackets as `e6T`; long roots of length
`2`). `e6dl`, `e6D`: the dual family `dⱼ = (1/Dⱼ) · vec (e6dl j)`. Checks: symmetry, `κ(bᵢ, dⱼ) = δᵢⱼ`, and the
adjoint Casimir `Σᵢ ⁅bᵢ, ⁅dᵢ, x⁆⁆ = 24 x` (so `h = 12`). Generated by `aff_e6_liedata.py` (untrusted).
-/

